<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 284 days of 1996:</p>
<p>---------------------------1996------1995----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,830.....7,786......0.6</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,341.....3,185......4.9</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............848.......839......1.1</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,577.....1,495......5.5</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,495.....4,328......3.9</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,091....17,633......2.6</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,477.....6,570.....-1.4</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,508.....7,268......3.3</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......14,159....14,012......1.0</p>
</text>
